-- Migration 044: 70 real, well-known ONLINE / virtual volunteer opportunities.
-- Every organization name was checked against the existing directory and against
-- the prior online-listings migration (006) - verified zero overlap (so this does
-- NOT re-add Zooniverse, Smithsonian Transcription Center, UPchieve, Learn To Be,
-- Crisis Text Line, Be My Eyes, Translators without Borders, UN Online Volunteering,
-- The Trevor Project, Operation Gratitude, DoSomething.org, iNaturalist, Tarjimly,
-- LibriVox, Distributed Proofreaders, Missing Maps, TED Translators, Cards for
-- Hospitalized Kids, Letters Against Isolation, Love For Our Elders, DOROT,
-- Wikipedia, or Soldiers' Angels, which are already in the database).
-- Every domain was HTTP-checked before writing this file. All rows are remote /
-- is_online with no city/state. Pure inserts with fixed ids - safe to re-run,
-- existing rows untouched.

insert into public.organizations
